  shared/xml-essentials.md
    Vendored verbatim from jgraph/drawio-mcp (shared/xml-essentials.md) and
    compiled into worker/reference.ts by scripts/build-reference.ts. It is the
    canonical source of draw.io XML generation guidance used in the system
    prompt. Run `bun run ref` after updating it.

  draw.io viewer (vendor/viewer-static.min.js)
    Vendored byte-for-byte from https://viewer.diagrams.net/js/viewer-static.min.js
    and served from this app's own origin, so preview and image export work
    offline and without disclosing diagrams to a third party. The bundle's
    optional stencil, style and math paths still default to diagrams.net and are
    only requested for diagrams that use those libraries.

